// captured trip name, region, dates; we don\'t re-ask for them here.
// Output is synthesized into the parseResult shape that
// _buildPickerFromPastedList expects (destinations[] with isStay flag),
// so all the downstream pipeline (PD.74 role apply, PD.75 stays
