        + "Trip context: " + brief + "\n"
        + regionGuard
        + geoScopeHint
        + "The traveler has named these " + _listedCount + " places already (the MASTER LIST):\n"
        + _enrichMasterList + "\n\n"
        + "For each of these " + eBatch.length + " places, suggest 1-2 NEARBY sights or activities (within ~50 km) that are NOT already in the master list:\n"
        + eBatchNames + "\n\n"
        + "Each suggestion must:\n"
        + "  (a) be SPECIFIC — name the sight, what makes it worth visiting, NOT a generic 'scenic viewpoints nearby';\n"
        + "  (b) actually be nearby the place it's tied to (under ~50 km driving);\n"
        + "  (c) NOT duplicate anything in the master list (check carefully — the user already has those);\n"
        + "  (d) NOT be a famous gateway city the traveler obviously knows about and chose to skip — focus on the under-the-radar.\n\n"
        + pStayConstraint
        + "Return ONLY a JSON array (no markdown):\n"
        + '[{"place":"Sight or Town","country":"Country","near":"Listed place from the batch this is near","role":"sight","stayRange":"0 nights OR 1 night","singleSight":true,"whyItFits":"What makes it specifically worth a side trip — name the trail, the dish, the building, the view.","tradeoffs":"One honest downside.","tags":["tag1"],"otherAttractions":"","widelyRecommended":false,"lat":0.0,"lng":0.0}]\n'
