    // applyRequiredAndAutoKeep pass below. The picker is the contract:
    // what you picked is what builds. LLM-volunteered "accepted"
    // candidates (Borgarnes, Mývatn, Húsavík etc.) still appear in
    // the candidate-explorer for opt-in, but they no longer roll
