        // PD.75: synthetic top-of-picker section for the user's
        // pasted-list overnight stays so they don\'t scatter into
        // LLM-themed activity sections (or worse, "Other places to
        // consider"). Section name matches the rank-0 regex above.
        // PD.290: seed "Recommended overnight stays" from LLM overnight
        // candidates if the user didn't paste any stays. Without this,
        // a no-stays paste (or intent-only paste) ends up with overnight
        // bases scattered across LLM activity sections — no anchored
