    // …) line up as children of the context, not as equal siblings.
    // Trip Profile wrap closes after the travelers IIFE; Traveler
    // Profile wrap then opens and runs through Avoid (section 6).
    + '<div style="margin:6px 0 22px;padding:14px 0 14px 18px;border-left:3px solid var(--c-primary);">'
    + '<div style="margin-bottom:14px;">'
    +   '<div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--c-primary);margin-bottom:2px;">This trip</div>'
    +   '<div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#222;">Trip profile</div>'
    +   '<div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#666;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;">Specific to this trip — where you’re going, why, when, how you’d like to get around, and who’s going.</div>'
    + '</div>'

    // ── 1. THE DESTINATION ────────────────────────────────
    // v360.4: order reads where → why → when (concrete identity,
