// v359.55.8: unified picker-map-popup role writer. Three roles:
//   • "stay"    — explicit overnight (sets placeMeta.stayOverride=true,
//                 clears _isDayTrip)
//   • "see"     — explicit see-only, decide later in trip view
//                 (placeMeta.stayOverride=false, clears _isDayTrip)
//   • "daytrip" — committed day-trip from a hub (sets _isDayTrip=true,
