  // marker pass uses). Returns null when the place hasn't geocoded
  // yet; the spur pass below uses this to defer un-geocoded segments
  // until a re-render.
  // PD.487 (audit T2.4): removed the dead `_pmCoord(placeName)` helper. It
  // resolved coords by the RAW lowercase key only — alias-blind, the exact
  // twin of the PD.401S bug — but its caller was removed (with the ordinal
  // pass below) and it had ZERO call sites left, so it was a latent bug
