  // PD.358: pre-mint drafts live in ONE shared buffer (_PA_BUF) so
  // _tb.placeActivities and _mdcItems can never diverge, even before
  // a trip exists. Installing a fresh _tb resets the shared draft —
  // a new picker session starts clean, same as the old semantics.
  window._PA_BUF = window._PA_BUF || { arr: [] };
  window._PA_BUF.arr = Array.isArray(tb.placeActivities) ? tb.placeActivities : [];
