    // map's pin color depends on dest.nights (purple for 0-night "see"
    // stops, blue for overnights) — and nights mutations were reaching
    // this listener via tripChange but NOT through the separate
    // mapDataChange path used to drive updateMainMap. Coupling them
    // here means a nights flip (overnight ↔ see) repaints the pin
    // even on code paths that emit only tripChange (or that go
